          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\cos2\\alpha=-\\frac35,\\quad\\sin2\\alpha=\\frac45",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\cos\\beta=-\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{10},\\quad\\sin\\beta=-\\frac{3\\sqrt{10}}{10}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\cos(2\\alpha+\\beta)=\\frac{3\\sqrt{10}}{10}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第1問 (7)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "交点条件4x-x²=axから、原点でない交点のx座標は4-aです。2つの面積を別々に求めます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q1-parabola-line",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\frac16(4-a)^3",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokai-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p005",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "T=\\frac12a(4-a)^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "S:T=2:1へ代入し、4-a>0を使って約分するとa=4/7です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-01"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の進め方",
            "text": "(1)(2)で必要な内積をそろえ、(3)はRHがpとqに垂直、(4)はLをOQ上・PH上の2通りで表します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問 解答一覧",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1) ア",
                "value": "2"
              },
              {
                "label": "(1) イ",
                "value": "4"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2) ウ",
                "value": "\\(\\displaystyle{}\\frac18\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2) エ",
                "value": "1"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3) オ",
                "value": "4"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3) カ",
                "value": "2"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3) キ",
                "value": "\\(\\displaystyle{}-\\frac13\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3) ク",
                "value": "\\(\\displaystyle{}\\frac76\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(4) ケ",
                "value": "7"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問 (1)(2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-tetrahedron",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\vec p\\cdot\\vec q=2,\\qquad\\vec q\\cdot\\vec r=4",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokai-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p006",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "三角形OPRへ余弦定理を使うとcos∠POR=1/8、したがってp・r=1です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問 (3)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "OH=xp+yqなのでRH=xp+yq-rです。RHは平面OPQに垂直だから、pとqとの内積がともに0です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "4x+2y-1=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "2x+4y-4=0",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x=-\\frac13,\\qquad y=\\frac76",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokai-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p007",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第2問 (4)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "LをOQ上ではOL=kq、PH上ではPからHへの内分として表します。pとqの係数を比較するとk=7/8です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "OL:LQ=7:1",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q2-menelaus",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-02"
          },
          {
            "type": "note",
            "label": "この大問の進め方",
            "text": "角の二等分線上に円の中心が並びます。最初の内接円の半径rを決め、Dと円C'の位置からr'=r/3を得て、最後は台形から2扇形を除きます。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問 解答一覧 (1)〜(4)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(1) ア",
                "value": "\\(\\displaystyle{}\\frac1{\\sqrt3}x\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2) イ",
                "value": "\\(\\displaystyle{}\\frac{\\sqrt3-1}{2}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(2) ウ",
                "value": "\\(\\displaystyle{}\\frac{3-\\sqrt3}{2}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(3) エ",
                "value": "\\(\\displaystyle{}\\frac{3-\\sqrt3}{4}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(4) オ",
                "value": "\\(\\displaystyle{}\\frac{\\sqrt3-1}{6}\\)"
              },
              {
                "label": "(4) カ",
                "value": "\\(\\displaystyle{}\\frac{3-\\sqrt3}{6}\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokai-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p008",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問 解答一覧 (5)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "answer_key",
            "items": [
              {
                "label": "(5) キ",
                "value": "4"
              },
              {
                "label": "(5) ク",
                "value": "\\(\\displaystyle{}\\frac{11}{6}\\)"
              }
            ],
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問 (1)(2)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "∠AOB=60度なので二等分線の傾きはtan30度です。内心CからOAへの距離をrとすると、横方向は√3rです。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "y=\\frac1{\\sqrt3}x",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r=\\frac{\\sqrt3-1}{2},\\qquad x_C=\\frac{3-\\sqrt3}{2}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-incircle",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokai-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p009",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問 (3)(4)",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "OC=2rでCD=rなのでDはOCの中点です。次の円C'も同じ二等分線上にあり、DでCに外接します。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "x_D=\\frac{3-\\sqrt3}{4}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "r'=\\frac13r=\\frac{\\sqrt3-1}{6}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-two-circles",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "第3問 (5) 面積設定",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "求める領域は台形C'JHCから、中心角120度と60度の2扇形を除いた部分です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "source_page_id": "tokai-2025-general-mathematics-answers-p010",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "S=\\left(4\\sqrt3-\\frac{11}{6}\\pi\\right)r'^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "T=\\pi r'^2",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "formula",
            "latex": "\\frac ST=4\\frac{\\sqrt3}{\\pi}-\\frac{11}{6}",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "crop",
            "asset_id": "ans-q3-tangent-circles",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          },
          {
            "type": "prose",
            "text": "したがって空欄はキ=4、ク=11/6です。",
            "major_question_id": "major-question-03"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
